# Shop KhattaBook — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your Supabase credentials
# to switch from Demo/Local mode to full cloud mode.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase Project Credentials
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard → Project Settings → API
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WITHOUT these credentials → the app runs in Demo/Local Mode:
#   ✓ All data stored in browser localStorage
#   ✓ Google sign-in uses a demo mock account
#   ✓ OTP uses mock 6-digit codes (shown in the UI)
#   ✗ No real Google OAuth (browser popup)
#   ✗ No real SMS OTP delivery
#   ✗ No cross-device data sync
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# WITH Supabase configured → Full Cloud Mode:
#   ✓ Real Google OAuth via Supabase Auth
#   ✓ Real SMS OTP (configure phone provider in Supabase)
#   ✓ PostgreSQL database with Row Level Security
#   ✓ Data isolated per user via Supabase Auth user ID
#   ✓ Cross-device sync and real-time updates
